 ronmental Policy Act for Certain Terminations or Revocations of Water Powe
 r Licenses or Exemptions
DESCRIPTION:The Federal Energy Regulatory Commission amends its regulation
 s implementing the National Environmental Policy Act (NEPA) to expand an e
 xisting Categorical Exclusion (CE) to include "terminations or revocations
  of water power licenses and exemptions that will result in minor or no gr
 ound disturbing activity and minor or no changes in reservoir conditions a
 nd downstream flows."\nhttps://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/07/2
 3/2026-14878/categorical-exclusion-under-the-national-environmental-policy
 -act-for-certain-terminations-or
URL:https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/07/23/2026-14878/catego
